OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry day across the
OL,6,Fregion with variable and patchy cloud
OL,7,Fallowing long spells of sunshine to
OL,8,Fbreak through. Winds remaining light
OL,9,Fthroughout.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and settled night with
OL,12,Fmostly cloudy skies, though some clear
OL,13,Fintervals still possible. Winds
OL,14,Fstrengthening across the west,
OL,15,Fespecially the coasts, but lighter
OL,16,Fwinds elsewhere where a little chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
